WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.147 --> 00:00:02.730
(bright music)

00:00:04.098 --> 00:00:05.498
- [Narrator] Ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:05.498 --> 00:00:09.081
this is the Thousand-hand
Bodhisattva dance.

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:11.401
Pretty cool, huh?

00:00:12.255 --> 00:00:14.015
One would think that a
performance this difficult

00:00:14.015 --> 00:00:16.706
and precise, would
require all five senses.

00:00:16.706 --> 00:00:18.867
Well think again,
because all these dancers

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:20.195
can't hear the music,

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:23.195
making this performance even cooler.

00:00:25.851 --> 00:00:28.604
(traditional Chinese music)

00:00:28.604 --> 00:00:31.032
Founded in 1987, the
China Disabled Peoples'

00:00:31.032 --> 00:00:32.707
Performing Art Troupe performs eloquent

00:00:32.707 --> 00:00:35.285
dances, plays and operas.

00:00:35.285 --> 00:00:37.331
(dramatic string music)

00:00:37.331 --> 00:00:38.258
The music is performed

00:00:38.258 --> 00:00:39.840
by the visually impaired
and the dance numbers

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.772
are performed by those hard of hearing.

00:00:43.772 --> 00:00:45.778
The thousand hand Bodhisattva
dance is the troop's

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.586
most popular performance.

00:00:47.586 --> 00:00:49.114
It was also one of the
most difficult dances

00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:50.722
for them to learn.

00:00:50.722 --> 00:00:52.624
And that's where Xiangtian comes in.

00:00:52.624 --> 00:00:54.151
She and other instructors
use sign language

00:00:54.151 --> 00:00:56.484
to help conduct the dancers.

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:02.877
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:28.591
They also realized that spending time

00:01:28.591 --> 00:01:30.755
together offstage, would not
only enhance their friendship,

00:01:30.755 --> 00:01:33.922
but their performance onstage as well.

00:01:52.891 --> 00:01:54.027
(dramatic music)

00:01:54.027 --> 00:01:56.179
In Bin's case, he and
other musicians develop

00:01:56.179 --> 00:01:57.382
their own technique for playing

00:01:57.382 --> 00:01:59.549
without being able to see.

00:02:04.242 --> 00:02:08.159
(speaking in foreign language)

